                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='16'>&gt; Moderate to low debt-to-GDP</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='16'>-These include countries like </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='16'>Norway, Switzerland, Netherlands, New Zealand</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='16'> — all showing a stable fiscal position with strong workforce indicators.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='16'>-Prioritize these countries for investment as they align with Horizon’s goal of </run>
